{"id":"golang-keyword","cat":"golang","title":"Golang 关键字陷阱","file":"golang/keyword.md","authors":["csview-local 示例"],"type":"qa","questions":[{"id":"golang-keyword~1","n":1,"title":"slice 和数组有什么区别？","doc":"golang-keyword","cat":"golang","badges":[{"kind":"key","text":"重要"}],"leetcode":null,"words":272,"html":"<p>数组是<strong>值类型</strong>，长度是类型的一部分，<code>[3]int</code> 和 <code>[4]int</code> 是不同类型，赋值和传参都会整体拷贝。</p>\n<p>slice 是一个三字段的结构体：<code>{ptr, len, cap}</code>。传参只拷这 24 字节，但 <code>ptr</code> 指向同一底层数组，所以<strong>修改元素会影响调用方</strong>。</p>\n<p>危险的地方在于 <code>append</code>：</p>\n<figure class=\"codeblock\" data-lang=\"go\"><figcaption class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"cb-lang\">Go</span><span class=\"cb-meta\">5 行</span><button class=\"cb-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy aria-label=\"复制代码\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8\"/></svg><span>复制</span></button></figcaption><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light night-owl\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">a</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> :=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> make</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">([]</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\">2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\">4</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">)   </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">// len=2 cap=4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">b</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> :=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> append</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">a</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">)        </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">// 容量够，直接写进 a 的底层数组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">b</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\">0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">] </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 99</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">                // a[0] 也变成 99</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">c</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> :=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> append</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">a</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\">2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\">3</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">)  </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">// 超出 cap，扩容并拷贝到新数组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">c</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\">0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">] </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 7</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">                 // 此时不影响 a</span></span></code></pre></figure><div class=\"adm adm-warning\"><div class=\"adm-head\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10.3 3.9 2.6 17.2A2 2 0 0 0 4.3 20h15.4a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-2.8L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0Z\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4M12 16.6v.4\"/></svg><span>面试高频追问</span></div><div class=\"adm-body\"><p>「slice 作为参数传递会不会影响实参」没有单一答案：<strong>改元素会，append 不一定</strong>。是否影响取决于有没有触发扩容，这正是它容易出 bug 的原因。要完全隔离就显式 <code>copy</code> 或用 <code>s[:len:len]</code> 限制容量强制扩容。</p>\n</div></div>","toc":[],"freq":4},{"id":"golang-keyword~2","n":2,"title":"defer 的执行顺序和求值时机？","doc":"golang-keyword","cat":"golang","badges":[{"kind":"key","text":"重要"}],"leetcode":null,"words":136,"html":"<p>两条规则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>后进先出</strong>：多个 defer 按注册的逆序执行，像栈一样。</li>\n<li><strong>参数立即求值，函数体延迟执行</strong>：注册那一刻就把参数复制好。</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"codeblock\" data-lang=\"go\"><figcaption class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"cb-lang\">Go</span><span class=\"cb-meta\">8 行</span><button class=\"cb-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy aria-label=\"复制代码\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8\"/></svg><span>复制</span></button></figcaption><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light night-owl\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> f</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">() (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#D7DBE0\">r</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">    i</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> :=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">    defer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">() { </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">fmt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">闭包读到</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">i</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">) }()  </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">// 捕获变量，打印 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">    defer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\"> fmt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">参数固定为</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">i</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">)              </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">// 立即求值，打印 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">    i</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">++</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">    defer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">() { </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">r</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">++</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> }()                        </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">// 能改命名返回值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">    return</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 10</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">                                      // r 先被赋 10，再被 defer 改成 11</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure><p><code>return</code> 不是原子的：先把返回值赋给命名结果变量，再执行 defer 链，最后真正返回。所以<strong>只有命名返回值才能被 defer 修改</strong>。</p>\n","toc":[],"freq":3},{"id":"golang-keyword~3","n":3,"title":"make 和 new 的区别？","doc":"golang-keyword","cat":"golang","badges":[{"kind":"master","text":"掌握"}],"leetcode":null,"words":209,"html":"<ul>\n<li><code>new(T)</code>：分配一块零值内存，返回 <code>*T</code>。适用于任意类型。</li>\n<li><code>make(T, ...)</code>：<strong>只用于 slice、map、channel</strong>，返回的是 <code>T</code> 本身而不是指针，并且会初始化内部结构（底层数组、哈希桶、环形缓冲与锁）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>原因很直接：这三种类型是运行时结构，光有零值内存不可用。<code>var m map[string]int</code> 是 nil map，读取安全但<strong>写入直接 panic</strong>，必须 <code>make</code> 或字面量初始化。</p>\n","toc":[],"freq":1},{"id":"golang-keyword~4","n":4,"title":"nil channel、关闭的 channel 分别是什么行为？","doc":"golang-keyword","cat":"golang","badges":[{"kind":"key","text":"重要"}],"leetcode":null,"words":338,"html":"<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>nil channel</th>\n<th>已关闭 channel</th>\n<th>正常 channel</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>发送</td>\n<td>永久阻塞</td>\n<td><strong>panic</strong></td>\n<td>阻塞或成功</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接收</td>\n<td>永久阻塞</td>\n<td>立即返回零值，<code>ok=false</code></td>\n<td>阻塞或成功</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关闭</td>\n<td><strong>panic</strong></td>\n<td><strong>panic</strong></td>\n<td>成功</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>由此得到两条工程惯例：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>谁发送谁关闭</strong>，接收方绝不关闭；多发送方场景用额外的 done channel 或 <code>sync.Once</code> 协调。</li>\n<li>在 <code>select</code> 里把某个 case 的 channel 置为 nil，可以<strong>动态禁用这个分支</strong>，比用布尔标志加 default 更干净。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"adm adm-info\"><div class=\"adm-head\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 11v5M12 7.6v.6\"/></svg><span>为什么关闭后还能读</span></div><div class=\"adm-body\"><p>关闭只是「不再有新数据」的信号，缓冲区里已有的数据仍应被消费完。所以 <code>for v := range ch</code> 会在关闭且排空后自然退出，这是 fan-out 模式的基础。</p>\n</div></div>","toc":[],"freq":0}],"words":955,"intro":""}